 3246: // /**
 3247: //    For a point (x1,y1) inside the element and a line segment (x1,y1)-(x2,y2), find the intersection point 
 3248: //    (xIntersect,yIntersect) and the side (intersectingSide) that it intersects.
 3249: 
 3250: //    Inputs:
 3251: //    @param x1, y1: point inside the element
 3252: //    @param x2, y2: other end of the line segment
 3253: 
 3254: //    Outputs:
 3255: //    @param intersectingSide:  side that intersects the line segment
 3256: //    @param nextElement: element that contains the intersection point
 3257: //    @param xIntersect, yIntersect: intersection point  
